//\caRage
//\cnItem
//\cgEnraged

OptionValue UH_BossMainfire
{
0, "\cdFires explosion shots\nWhen \cgenraged\cd, shots 50% more damage"//TrueBusterExpert
1, "\cdFires revolver, strongest when near target\n\caFiring too much decreases stability"//HunterHawkeye
2, "\cdPowerful swipe forward\n\caDashes forward destroying anything\nDuration extends on hit"//DonJavier
3, "\cdFires an ice projectile\n\caExplodes on impact"//ElitistSue
4, "\cdRecoil on firing explosive shot\n\caShot rips, explodes, and good recoil"//ColonelKachidonga
5, "\cdAll styles have a melee and blade shot\n#1 Delayed strong shot\n#2 Slow 2 bounce shot\n#3 Rapid small shots"//KakusaretaSutoka
6, "\cdShotgun.\n\caLarge shot that explodes for a while"//OfficerJohnson
7, "\cdWhirlwind hugs floors if it hits floor\n\caBecome a tornado of damage while flying"//ElitistWaylon
8, "\cdRandomly perform attacks\n\caSummons deadly meteors"//ShinHellbot
9, "\cdCasts a giant explosive fireball"//CaptainDevilEye

10, "\cdShot splits into floating bits\n\caSplits into even more bits"//TricksterGiovanni
11, "\cdFires a rocket with a massive explosion\n\cnFire a deadly laser\n\caFires splitting drills that home"//IronCurtain
12, "\cdFires blades\n\caCharge shot fires a boomerang blade"//CaptainBlitzkrieg
13, "\cdShort invincibility at full ammo"//DicksterDick
14, "\cdIce shot\n\caSummons ice rain from the ceiling"//SovietFrostBite
15, "\cdFlame shot\n\caConstant fireballs that home"//SovietIgniter
16, "\cdElectric shot\n\caHastes self and has an electric aura"//RepairManEdward
17, "\cdExplosive bomb that spreads\n\caBlows up an area with random explosions"//RNCClashman
18, "\ckYellow\cd, spreading tornadoes \cj- \cgRed\cd, rapid\n\chBlue\cd, pinpoint delayed water tower\n\caInvincible charge, large shot noclips"//ArchArcanist
19, "\caREAL MEGUH BUSTER, long lasting laser"//MeguhMang

20, "\cdFires a volley of homing magnets\n\caPulls foes to user for contact damage"//Magnetismo
21, "\cdRapid shot that restore item ammo on hit\nUses Nega Barrier when under 50% base hp\nRams forward, heal back to 50% base hp\nBecomes \cgenraged \cdwhen done"//ShinNegaman
22, "\cdGems fired are random\nEach color behaves differently"//GemBanker
23, "\cdBoomerang mace that stops in place\n\caDashes to destroy with critical strike"//Dixieandoff
24, "\cdGeneric punch"//GENERICBOSS
25, "\cdAfter firing, a clone fires"//TrueBusterMistress
26, "\cdLife 1, basic boomerang ripper\nLife 2, boomerang has damage trails\nLife 3, not a boomerang, sticks to walls"//CuttyCut
27, "\cdSpread of shots\n\caSpread of explosive shots"//Pharaohman4MI
28, "\cdBasic shot\nTurns off altfire if active"//Skullman4MI
29, "\cdBasic Star Crash\nShield throw homes/rips\n\caPinpoint meteor"//AstromancerComplex

30, "\cdBasic Star Crash\nShield throw is fast\n\caPinpoint meteor"//AstromancerSimple
31, "\cdFire a chargeable Screw Crusher"//JuggerbroGold
32, "\cdFire screws at increasing speed\nAt max power, fire 3 screws"//JuggerbroSilver
33, "\cdRapidly fires bursts of bullets"//RedBaronDuo
34, "\cdRapidly fires bursts of bullets"//BlueJayDuo
35, "\cdFire basic shots\n\caFire 3 strong missiles with great recoil"//RedTankBot
36, "\cdRapidly fire basic shots\n\caFire 4 homing explosive missiles"//BluTankBot
37, "\ckREALLY \cdrapidly fire basic shots\n\caFire a large wall of explosive missiles"//YelTankBot
38, "\cdStrong Explosive shot"//RedHero
39, "\cdExplosive shot"//BlueHero

40, "\cdRapid shot"//YellowHero
41, "\cdSpread explosive shot"//PurpleHero
42, "\cdFire a multi-explosion shot"//Faggasso
43, "\cdChargable explosive shot"//RedFaggasso
44, "\cdDetonatable explosive shot"//BlueFaggasso
45, "\cdHoming delayed lightning strike"//YellowFaggasso
46, "\cdPicks up/Tosses a fast boulder\n\caPicks up/Tosses a slow explosive rock"//GutsBuddy
47, "\cdPicks up/Tosses a boulder\n\caCharges up to toss rock harder"//RussianGuts
48, "\cdPicks up a rock slowly\nTosses slow explosive rock after delay"//RedeadGuts
